// Ill-formed: violates C7 (client-server style). The operator panel (T1) requests directly
// from the translator (T2) instead of a T3 service.
system FTS
constituent FTS "Sistema de Transporte Fluvial" owner "Operadores de navegación fluvial"
component PAN "Panel del Operador Fluvial" in FTS tier T1 kind software
component CON "Servicio de Consulta de Estado" in FTS tier T3 kind software
component TRA "Traductor de Modelo Canónico" in FTS tier T2 kind software
connector E_K30 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Consulta de estado consolidado de la carga"
  : PAN -> CON
connector E_K98 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Consulta directa al traductor"
  : PAN -> TRA
